    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5187" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμετα-κίνητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be moved from place
				to place, immovable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				343a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				212a15
			</span></i>; of persons, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				8.74
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, ἔχειν</span> stand <i>unmoved,</i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1105a33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Mis.</u>
				348d
			</span></i>, al.</div>
